{%- comment -%}
  Mantelzorgdashboard (Alarm.com Wellness) — docs/pakket-wijzigingen-2026-09-23.md §12.

  Rendered only by sections/oplossingen.liquid, inside the Langer Thuis tab panel
  (#panel-langer-thuis), in .mzd-row together with the Langer Thuis pakket-matcher and
  before "Waarom Zo Veilig". From 1100px it sits beside the matcher's heading, tiles and
  advice, with the comparison table full width below both; narrower, it comes after the
  advice and before the table (see assets/zv-mantelzorgdashboard.css). Because it sits
  inside that panel, the tab JS hides it together with the rest of the panel when another
  tab is active; it has no JS of its own.

  Param:
    block   the oplossingen section block of type 'mantelzorgdashboard' (limit 1, so
            id="mantelzorgdashboard" is unique on the page).

  Every text is a block setting, and the spec copy is both the schema default and the
  value stored in templates/page.oplossingen.json. No `| default:` fallbacks on the texts:
  blanking a field in the theme editor hides that element instead of bringing the spec
  copy back.

  Badge: `badge`, a small tag directly under the heading ("Bij alle Langer
  Thuis-pakketten: …", 2026-09-24). Blank hides it.

  Image: image_picker `image`, to be filled with an official Alarm.com asset uploaded to
  Shopify Files. While it is empty the image column is not rendered at all (no
  placeholder) and the `mzd--noimg` modifier lets the text take the full card width.
  Beside the matcher (≥1100px) the image goes above the four items instead of in a column.
  Alt text: the file's own alt text, else the heading.

  Deep link: the Inzicht bullet "Familie-app voor mantelzorgers" links here through the
  zv-route key 'oplossingen/mantelzorgdashboard', which outputs the bare fragment
  '#mantelzorgdashboard'.

  Styles: assets/zv-mantelzorgdashboard.css, loaded by sections/oplossingen.liquid before
  .mzd-row (colour tokens from zv-chrome.css).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign s = block.settings
  assign mzd_img = s.image
  assign mzd_alt = mzd_img.alt | default: s.heading
-%}
<section class="mzd{% if mzd_img == blank %} mzd--noimg{% endif %}" id="mantelzorgdashboard" data-section-name="mantelzorgdashboard"{% if s.heading != blank %} aria-labelledby="mzd-heading"{% endif %} {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="mzd__card">
    <div class="mzd__copy">
      {%- if s.heading != blank -%}<h3 class="mzd__h" id="mzd-heading">{{ s.heading | escape }}</h3>{%- endif -%}
      {%- if s.badge != blank -%}<p class="mzd__badge">{{ s.badge | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
      {%- if s.intro != blank -%}<p class="mzd__intro">{{ s.intro | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
      <ul class="mzd__list">
        {%- for i in (1..4) -%}
          {%- assign k_t = 'item_' | append: i | append: '_title' -%}
          {%- assign k_x = 'item_' | append: i | append: '_text' -%}
          {%- assign k_n = 'item_' | append: i | append: '_note' -%}
          {%- if s[k_t] != blank or s[k_x] != blank -%}
            <li class="mzd__item">
              {%- if s[k_t] != blank -%}<h4 class="mzd__t">{{ s[k_t] | escape }}</h4>{%- endif -%}
              {%- if s[k_x] != blank -%}<p class="mzd__x">{{ s[k_x] | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
              {%- if s[k_n] != blank -%}<p class="mzd__note">{{ s[k_n] | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
            </li>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
      {%- if s.closing != blank -%}<p class="mzd__closing"><strong>{{ s.closing | escape }}</strong></p>{%- endif -%}
    </div>
    {%- if mzd_img != blank -%}
      <div class="mzd__media">
        {{ mzd_img | image_url: width: 1080 | image_tag: alt: mzd_alt, loading: 'lazy', widths: '360, 540, 720, 900, 1080', sizes: '(min-width: 1100px) 360px, (min-width: 821px) 36vw, calc(100vw - 100px)', class: 'mzd__img' }}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</section>
